<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 58; padding-top: 1.8; padding-bottom: 1.8; padding-left: 2.2; padding-right: 2.2; background-color: #0f0a1af2; border-color: #b060ff; border-width: 0.12; border-radius: 0.8; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 0.9; font-weight: 700; color: #b060ff; margin-bottom: 0.3; }
  .heading { font-size: 1.8; font-weight: 700; color: #f2e8ff; margin-bottom: 0.6; }
  .hint { font-size: 1; color: #9888c0; margin-bottom: 0.8; }
  .btn { width: 100%; height: 2.8; background-color: #5a3a9a; border-radius: 1.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #f2e8ff; font-size: 1.15; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.6; }
  .btn-collapse { width: 100%; height: 2.4; background-color: #1d2a3b; border-radius: 1.2; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #e8e8e8; font-size: 1.1; cursor: pointer; }
  .result { font-size: 1; color: #d8c8f0; margin-top: 0.8; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="counterfactual-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">COUNTERFACTUAL CHAMBER - sealed, never executed</span>
  <span class="heading">Compare two worlds</span>
  <span class="hint" id="cf-hint">exclusion needs no login; containment effect needs an operator session - MNEME's authority gate decides, not this panel</span>
  <button class="btn" id="cf-exclusion">Exclusion forecast (mem-gate)</button>
  <button class="btn" id="cf-containment">Containment effect (mem-poison)</button>
  <button class="btn-collapse" id="cf-collapse">Collapse chamber</button>
  <span class="result" id="cf-result"></span>
</div>
